---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import { business } from '../data/business';
---

<Base
  title="About 2.0 Air | Air Sealing, Spokane & North Idaho"
  description="2-OH Air Solutions LLC (2.0 Air) does high-performance whole-house air sealing for new homes in Spokane and North Idaho. Insured and bonded."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">About us</span>
      <h1>About 2.0 Air</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        {business.legalName}, also known as 2.0 Air or 2-OH Air, provides high-performance whole-house air sealing for new construction.
      </p>

      <h2>Our name</h2>
      <p>
        The “2.0” in our name comes from 2.0 ACH, a demanding standard for how airtight a house is. Not every house is built to that number. Each project has its own airtightness target, such as 3.0, 2.0, or 1.5, and we plan our air sealing around it.
      </p>

      <h2>Services</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Pre-Drywall and Post-Drywall Air Sealing for new construction</li>
        <li>Standalone Drywall Air Sealing for select builders</li>
        <li>Liquid-applied air barrier, caulk, and foam</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who we work with</h2>
      <p>We work with home builders and homeowners on new construction.</p>
      <h3>Home builders</h3>
      <p>
        We plan our air sealing around your project’s airtightness target and the stage of the build. We can seal before
        drywall, after drywall, or both, and we offer drywall air sealing as a standalone service for select builders.
        Blower door testing is handled by your energy rater or another third party, so you get an independent result.
      </p>
      <h3>Homeowners</h3>
      <p>
        If you are building a new home, we can work with you and your builder to seal the house while it is under
        construction. Share your project details and airtightness target, and we will
        plan the work around them.
      </p>

      <h2>Service area</h2>
      <p>
        We primarily serve the Spokane area and North Idaho, including {business.towns.washington.join(', ')} in Washington, and
        {' '}{business.towns.idaho.join(', ')} in Idaho.
      </p>

      <h2>Insured and bonded</h2>
      <p>2-OH Air Solutions LLC is insured and bonded.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBand />
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 780px;
  }
  h2 {
    margin-top: 1.6em;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
